tuesday, maybe wednesday.

the kettle has been broken for nine days and i keep filling it anyway.
there are four cups on the desk. i know which one is the newest.
rain again. the kind that doesn't fall, it just stays.

i answered one email today. it took three hours.
the dentist called twice. i let it ring and watched the screen go dark.

wrote the address on the back of my hand again.
unsentsessions.neocities.org
then washed it off, like that would help.

someone asked how i was and i said fine and meant it
the way you mean a word you've said too many times.

i should open the window. i should eat something.
the plant on the shelf is doing better than me, which is embarrassing
for both of us.

tomorrow i'll start over.
